window.COURSE_SUPPLEMENTS={
  3:[{pages:[8,11,13],kind:'verified',title:{zh:'有效性与健全性需要分开',en:'Separate validity from soundness'},zh:'补充辨析：演绎有效性关注前提若为真时，结论是否可能为假；健全论证还要求前提为真。不能只凭结论碰巧为真就判定论证有效。前提的数量也不是演绎或归纳的普遍定义。原页仍按原文保留。',en:'Deductive validity asks whether true premises could have a false conclusion. A sound argument is also based on true premises. A conclusion that happens to be true does not establish validity. A fixed number of premises is not a general definition of deduction or induction. The original slides remain unchanged.',references:[{label:'Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy · Logical Consequence',url:'https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/logical-consequence/'}]}],
  4:[{pages:[12],kind:'source',title:{zh:'原文时间单位存在疑点',en:'An inconsistent time unit in the original'},zh:'本页“eighth month”和随后“约30周”的组合存在明显的内部不一致。逐页层忠实保留原文，不能把此页直接作为准确的发育时间表。复习时可将此处列为向教师核对的问题。',en:'The combination of “eighth month” and “about 30 weeks” is internally inconsistent. The source layer preserves the wording; this page should not be used as an accurate developmental timetable. Keep it as a point to check with the instructor.'}],
  6:[{pages:[6,7],kind:'verified',title:{zh:'JTB 是经典模型，充分性仍有争论',en:'JTB is a classical model with contested sufficiency'},zh:'信念、真与证成是课件采用的经典三条件。补充阅读中的盖梯尔问题说明，三项同时满足仍可能不足以构成知识。因此互动图解显示“满足经典条件”，不据此断言所有知识问题已解决。',en:'Belief, truth and justification form the classical model used in the course. Gettier problems challenge whether meeting all three is sufficient for knowledge. The interaction therefore reports satisfaction of the classical conditions, not a final solution to the analysis of knowledge.',references:[{label:'Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy · The Analysis of Knowledge',url:'https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/knowledge-analysis/'}]}],
  7:[{pages:[15],kind:'verified',title:{zh:'“Karl Max 发起启蒙”的年代问题',en:'The chronology of “Karl Max launched the Enlightenment”'},zh:'原页把启蒙运动与“Karl Max”相连。如果此名意指 Karl Marx（马克思），其生年为1818年；学术概述通常把启蒙核心放在17世纪后期与18世纪。因此“由马克思发起启蒙”不应作为准确史实记忆。此结论是依据两项来源所作的年代核对，原文未改写。',en:'If “Karl Max” means Karl Marx, he was born in 1818, while the Enlightenment is centred on the late seventeenth and eighteenth centuries. The claim that Marx launched it should not be memorised as historical fact. This clarification infers a chronological conflict from the two sources; it preserves the original wording.',references:[{label:'SEP · Enlightenment',url:'https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/enlightenment/'},{label:'SEP · Karl Marx',url:'https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/marx/'}]}],
  8:[{pages:[10],kind:'verified',title:{zh:'不要把互联网和万维网放进19世纪',en:'Do not place the Internet and Web in the nineteenth century'},zh:'课件把计算机、互联网等列入“19世纪”栏，存在年代混排。互联网早期分组交换与网络建设属于20世纪；CERN记载万维网（WWW）于1989年提出。Internet与Web并非同一概念，不能把1989年称为互联网本身的诞生年。',en:'The nineteenth-century column mixes periods. Early packet switching and Internet networking belong to the twentieth century. CERN dates the invention of the World Wide Web to 1989. The Internet and Web are distinct; 1989 should not be presented as the birth of the Internet itself.',references:[{label:'Internet Society · A Brief History of the Internet',url:'https://www.internetsociety.org/internet/history-internet/brief-history-internet/'},{label:'CERN · The birth of the Web',url:'https://home.cern/science/computing/the-birth-of-the-web/'}]},{pages:[16,19],kind:'verified',title:{zh:'原文“1990”应与1991年记录核对',en:'Check the original “1990” against 1991 records'},zh:'原页出现把苏联终结写为1990年的表述。联合国记录，俄罗斯于1991年12月24日通知秘书长延续苏联在联合国的成员资格。这里提供可核查的1991年节点，避免把原页的1990年直接用于历史时间线。',en:'The slides refer to the end of the Soviet Union as 1990. UN records describe Russia’s letter of 24 December 1991 continuing the USSR’s UN membership. This supplies a verifiable 1991 reference point and avoids carrying the slide’s 1990 date directly into a timeline.',references:[{label:'United Nations · Russian Federation',url:'https://www.un.org/en/about-us/member-states/russian-federation'}]}]
};
